+<section id="daily-benchmark" class="prose-section" aria-labelledby="daily-benchmark-title">
+<p class="eyebrow">Daily engineering benchmark · 18 November 2026</p>
+<h2 id="daily-benchmark-title">50 public pull requests across 26 external projects.</h2>
+<p>Timothy Anderson directed the work with ChatGPT, ran parallel checks through GDN and personally reviewed the results. GitHub recorded the 50th submission at 11:16 pm Brisbane time. The total includes changes prepared earlier and opened on the day.</p>
+<p><a href="https://github.com/search?q=is%3Apr+is%3Apublic+author%3Atimothyanderson096-ocdealcheck+created%3A2026-11-17T14%3A00%3A00Z..2026-11-18T13%3A59%3A59Z&amp;type=pullrequests">Inspect the day’s 50 pull requests on GitHub ↗</a></p>
+<h3>Two fixes you can check</h3>
+<ul>
+<li><strong>GPSBabel.</strong> A GPS file conversion could lose turn and landmark symbols. The fix preserved all 188 original course cues in two cycling recordings. All 76 native tests passed. <a href="https://github.com/GPSBabel/gpsbabel/pull/1674">Inspect the GPSBabel fix ↗</a></li>
+<li><strong>Pexpect.</strong> A program writing UTF-16 output could fail before it started. The regression test launches a real child process and checks its output. All 258 project tests passed. <a href="https://github.com/pexpect/pexpect/pull/850">Inspect the Pexpect fix ↗</a></li>
+</ul>
+<h3>How 50 compares</h3>
+<p>In five Brisbane weekdays from 18–22 November 2024, <strong>321 of 338,205 active account-days</strong> reached 50 public pull request openings. That puts a 50-submission day in the <strong>top 0.1% of this sample by daily volume</strong>.</p>
+<p>Each account contributed one observation per day it opened a public pull request. The count excludes account names ending in <code>[bot]</code>. Other automation can appear in the data. GitHub records submissions and merges separately. Assess the changes themselves through the linked code and tests.</p>
+<p><a href="https://github.com/timothyanderson096-ocdealcheck/gdn-engineering-benchmarks/blob/main/evidence/2026-11-18-brisbane-pr-benchmark.md">Read the benchmark, peer comparisons and query ↗</a> · <a href="https://www.gharchive.org/">Explore the source data ↗</a></p>
